=== Arity Overloads Sample ===
--- Mist arity overloads ---
Wrapper(hello)
Wrapper<T>(42)
Wrapper<T1,T2>(active, True)
Wrapper<T1,T2,T3>(1, two, 3)
--- CLR generic arity ---
List<int>.Count: 3
Dictionary<string,int>.Count: 2
--- Type alias coexistence ---
Result<int>: Ok(42)
Result<string>: Err
--- Field types ---
Wrapper(fixed)
Wrapper<T>(100)
Wrapper<T1,T2>(flag, True)
Wrapper<T1,T2,T3>(7, seven, True)
--- Method parameters ---
plain: Wrapper(hello)
single: Wrapper<T>(42)
pair: Wrapper<T1,T2>(active, True)
Done!
